OL,3,GNEWSATeacher misses sentencing for
OL,4,Aindecent assault on pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer trial heard the chemistry teacher
OL,7,Fwore short tight skirts and flirted in
OL,8,Fclass, with one former pupil comparing
OL,9,Fher behaviour to "a Sabrina Carpenter
OL,10,Fvideo".
OL,12,FAfter being convicted earlier this year
OL,13,Fof seven counts of indecent assault,
OL,14,Fthe 65-year-old was granted bail and
OL,15,Fwas due to be sentenced at Harrow Crown
OL,16,FCourt on Friday.
